<title>USA: Projectavision settles lawsuit.</title>
<headline>Projectavision settles lawsuit.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Projectavision Inc said Friday it has settled a lawsuit filed by a buyer of its subordinated convertible debentures in May 1996.</p>
<p>Terms of the settlement were not disclosed but Projectavision said it involved no cost to the company.</p>
<p>It also said a suit filed in June 1966 by an investor against Projectavision and certain executives has been dismissed by a federal court in Florida for lack of jurisdiction.</p>
<p>Projectavision makes the Home Theater Television systems.</p>
</text>
